**Issue**: The paymentButtonOptions IIFE executes on EVERY render, replacing the previous useMemo that only recomputed when dependencies changed.

**Reasoning**: IIFEs run unconditionally on every render. This expensive computation (building dropdown options, filtering payment methods, checking policies) should only run when dependencies change. The removed comment explicitly stated: "We dont want to reorder the options when the preferred payment method changes while the button is still visible."

**Fix**: Revert to useMemo:

```tsx
const paymentButtonOptions = useMemo(() => {
    // ... logic
    return buttonOptions;
}, [paymentMethods, iouReport, translate, formattedAmount, /* other deps */]);
```

